    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Walking Trade</strong> is a quirky, action-packed zombie apocalypse store management game where chaos and commerce collide!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/f21922d02f4fb021cec12e6aa2c2527f.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your shop, balancing space, aesthetics, and functionality. Organize shelves, set prices, and ensure customers leave happy - or at least alive.<i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.poster.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.webm?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.mp4?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/dcadb8da1a15837382751338d21801cc.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers aren\u2019t your only problem - zombies invade! Wield melee weapons, firearms, or whatever you can find to defend your shop during raids and hordes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.poster.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.webm?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.mp4?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/8183750a24a4d98b505669c948747757.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire survivors to scavenge supplies, serve customers, or guard the shop. Keep them equipped and motivated to reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.poster.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.webm?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/4a80ee65da96bee17680283c7af3f709.mp4?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/0d5d6aeabc5c2ebc16f9798231075484.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock crafting stations to create weapons, tools, and shop upgrades. Build barricades, storage units, and even makeshift traps to keep zombies at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.poster.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.webm?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.mp4?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/40aba1f6b1e5a83b1ec656a53c2bdc69.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a benevolent shopkeeper or an opportunistic overlord. Help the community, price gouge, or even sabotage settlements for profit. Your reputation determines who comes knocking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.poster.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.webm?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.mp4?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br>In <strong>The Walking Trade</strong>, every decision shapes your survival. Build, fight, and thrive in the apocalypse\u2014your way!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Walking Trade</strong> is a quirky, action-packed zombie apocalypse store management game where chaos and commerce collide!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/f21922d02f4fb021cec12e6aa2c2527f.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your shop, balancing space, aesthetics, and functionality. Organize shelves, set prices, and ensure customers leave happy - or at least alive.<i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.poster.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.webm?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.mp4?t=1754048860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/dcadb8da1a15837382751338d21801cc.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers aren\u2019t your only problem - zombies invade! Wield melee weapons, firearms, or whatever you can find to defend your shop during raids and hordes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.poster.avif?t=1754048860\" width=616 height=346 ><sou